    "A point for every brick you place, and a point for every cell you clear.\n\nBreak more than one line with a single piece and those cleared cells pay one and a half times — a row and a column crossing counts as 19 cells, not 20." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每放下一块砖得 1 分，每消除一格也得 1 分。\n\n用一个方块同时消除多条线，那些格子按 1.5 倍计分——一行和一列交叉时算 19 格，而不是 20 格。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每放下一塊磚得 1 分，每消除一格也得 1 分。\n\n用一個方塊同時消除多條線，那些格子按 1.5 倍計分——一行和一列交叉時算 19 格，而不是 20 格。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
